        },
        {
            "+content": "Born with extraordinary magical power, Lacey has spent her entire life bound by a contract to serve her country. With no dreams or aspirations of her own, she's been given just two duties: defeat the Demon King and marry the noble chosen for her so she can bear an heir to inherit her mana. With the first goal completed, she's preparing to fulfill her final duty. Her former comrade, Wayne, urges her to dream of a different future, but Lacey has long since resigned herself to her fate. She's even prepared to burn her beloved staff to appease the man she's supposed to marry. Then one day, she and Wayne stumble upon her husband-to-be cheating on her with multiple women, including the princess. As the scandal comes to light before the king, Lacey finds herself at a crossroads. After a lifetime of having her choices made for her, she finally takes the first step toward the one thing she's never had: the freedom to live for herself.",
            "+@gid": "2935145391",
            "+@type": "Plot Summary"
